    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The researchers achieved a <strong>3 dB bandwidth of 110 GHz</strong> and demonstrated <strong>140 Gbaud on\u2013off keying modulation</strong> without digital signal processing. The modulator's performance is comparable to that of other high-bandwidth silicon modulators, but with the advantage of not using resonant structures.",
